{"id":"conv_05074","context":"A uni student interviews a retired labor researcher at home","ambient":"living_room_quiet","cast":["hiroshi_elder","ren_uni"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Professor, today I came to ask about the history of postwar mine labor for my thesis.","jp":"先生、今日は卒論のために戦後の鉱山労働の歴史についてお話を伺いに来ました。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,3,5,8,14,28,60,75,141,228,393,442,730,779,1666,2136,4781,5804,9024,9154,13968],"jpTokens":[{"s":"先生","r":"せんせい","w":228},{"s":"、"},{"s":"今日","r":"きょう","w":141},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"卒論","r":"そつろん","w":13968},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"ため","w":60},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"戦後","r":"せんご","w":2136},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"鉱山","r":"こうざん","w":9024},{"s":"労働","r":"ろうどう","w":393},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"歴史","r":"れきし","w":442},{"s":"について","w":75},{"s":"お話","r":"おはなし","w":730},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"伺い","r":"うかがい","w":1666},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"来","r":"き","w":779},{"s":"まし","w":14},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"Glad you came. The sites back then were truly brutal, even guard boards to prevent tunnel collapse were lacking.","jp":"よく来たね。当時の現場は本当に過酷でね、坑道の崩落を防ぐガードの板すら足りない有様だったよ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,3,5,8,13,21,51,68,73,178,289,555,779,1039,2197,2283,2761,4240,8979,9022,15852,15862],"jpTokens":[{"s":"よく","w":178},{"s":"来","r":"き","w":779},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"。"},{"s":"当時","r":"とうじ","w":555},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"現場","r":"げんば","w":1039},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"本当に","r":"ほんとうに","w":289},{"s":"過酷","r":"かこく","w":9022},{"s":"で","w":21},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"、"},{"s":"坑道","r":"こうどう"},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"崩落","r":"ほうらく"},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"防ぐ","r":"ふせぐ","w":4240},{"s":"ガード","w":8979},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"板","r":"いた","w":2761},{"s":"すら","w":2197},{"s":"足り","r":"たり","w":15852},{"s":"ない","w":13},{"s":"有様","r":"ありさま","w":15862},{"s":"だっ","w":21},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"e